      "releaseNotes": "What’s New\n• New Favourites – Save lounges and experiences for quick and easy access.\n• Personalised Explore – Enjoy improved preferred airport selections and destination imagery.\n• Refreshed Experience – Discover new splash screen and Welcome animations.\n• Simpler Onboarding – Manage your membership more easily.\n• Better Search – Find airports more easily across multiple languages.\n• Easier Feedback – Access visit ratings directly from the app.\nBug Fixes & Improvements\n• General bug fixes and performance improvements for a smoother experience.",
