      "currency": "GBP",
      "description": "We’re rolling out the Priority Pass+ App step by step. We’ll notify you as soon as it’s your turn to make the switch. Until then, keep enjoying the current Priority Pass App for the experience you know and love.  \n\nActivate your membership in the Priority Pass+ App in just 2 easy steps and enjoy access to 1,900+ lounges and airport experiences worldwide. \n\nDiscover an ever-growing range of premium experiences, from spas and sleep pods to in-airport dining, turning every journey into something special.  \n\nEnjoy contactless entry with your Digital Membership Card \n\nTrack your current membership entitlements and visit history \n\nView recommended lounges and experiences based on your travel plans  \n\nActivate, view and manage all your Priority Pass memberships in one place  \n\n\nEnrich your airport experience with the Priority Pass+ App.",
